      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Reporting",
      "items": [
        "CMP-REP is the widest consumer in the design: seven dependencies, one per kind of evidence it renders.",
        "It reads results from both runners, coverage, change impact and trace links, and emits through CMP-PLG."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Traceability",
      "items": [
        "CMP-TRC links requirements to test cases to code locations — the same job trace_check.py does for this repository's own design.",
        "It reads the analysis model and the case store, and persists links through CMP-PRJ."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Scope of this view",
      "items": [
        "CMP-REP and CMP-TRC are the two L4 components this view owns; every edge leaving them is drawn.",
